<p>In 2004 the head of the Krasnoyarsk region ran with initiative of building the Funpark “Bobrovy Log” in Krasnoyarsk. His initiative  was supported by the top managers of the “Norilsk Nickel” Company and state government agencies. On the regional level of discussing the project it was defined as public-private partnership, on the city level it was defined as municipal property.</p>

<p>The general investor of the project is PJSC “MMC “Norilsk Nickel” gave 2516,87 million to build the Complex. Infrastructure’s investor is the Krasnoyarsk city’s Administration that invested 276 million rubles. At the suggestion of the city’s Administration and the Krasnoyarsk territory Legislative Assembly while building the Funpark we have carried out works on hardening the bank of the Bazaikha river and delivering energy to the Bazaikha village.</p>

<p>December 3, 2006 the Funpark “Bobroby Log” had celebrated its official opening ceremony.</p>

<p>The implementation of the project had a few steps:</p>

<ul>
	<li>In December 2006 the first part of the Funpark’s objects was put in commission in a format of an “Alpine Skiing Complex”. While building the Funpark we used the global engineering experience of the Canadian Ecosing company, we took into consideration both the local lie of the ground and the close location to the national park “Stolby”. Natural characteristics of the skiing zone were improved with the modern snow-making system and snow compaction equipment. This fact enables skiing season to last for six months. Funpark’s objects offer our visitors facilities for enjoying winter sports and activities comfortably taking into account high world-wide requirements and standards.</li>
	
	<li>In July 2007 in the format of “Amusement park with the elements of all year round program” we started the objects of the second part of the Funpark among them are the Complex Mirage that has a beach zone and an outdoor swimming pool, Rodelbahn attraction and the biggest outdoor rock-climbing wall in Russia. In July 2008 the infrastructure was supplied with new open-air objects in the format of all year round. It included a place for picnics, Ziprider attraction and an altitude rope city, a bar in the Complex Mirage.</li>
</ul>

<p>The Funpark “Bobrovy Log” has become a favourite place among both locals and the guests of the city for a family vocations and activities at any time of a year.</p>